2026-07-28T07:03:59.7184432Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-28T07:03:59.7185056Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-28T07:03:59.7186007Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-28T07:03:59.7186722Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
